Semanto by Trooth app embed. Adds the two site-wide head tags from
adapters/head-tag/README.md before </head> on every page: the link to the
store's signed Semanto copy and the pointer to its facts as JSON-LD. The
Trooth ID and the API address come from the app's own installation
metafields (app.metafields.trooth), written by the app when the store is
connected and removed on Disconnect, so the merchant types nothing here and
the embed adds nothing while the store is not connected.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign trooth_id = app.metafields.trooth.trooth_id.value -%}
{%- assign trooth_api = app.metafields.trooth.api_base.value | default: 'https://api.trooth.co' -%}
{%- if trooth_id != blank -%}
<link rel="https://trooth.co/rel/semanto" href="{{ trooth_api | escape }}/public/semanto/{{ trooth_id | url_encode }}">
<script type="application/ld+json" src="{{ trooth_api | escape }}/public/semanto/{{ trooth_id | url_encode }}/facts.jsonld"></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Semanto by Trooth",
  "target": "head",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
